{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep the public record at seven components. Adding `xRayTraceId` changes record-pattern arity, reflection, equality/hash-code, and serializer-visible shape, breaking existing consumers despite retaining the old constructor. Carry the snapshot in separate immutable metadata, such as through a default hook overload that delegates to the existing hook, and leave `InvocationInfo`'s component list unchanged.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77AH-l","finding_digest":"32d77b84d4097416e8b5d61e3b981eaeb448a2af0042bfecaa9021e1f750a58b","finding_id":"arf_v1_gllxxbgubf2bn2fv2ypdxga6v2","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/invocationinfo::record-components::public-source-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/invocationinfo::record-components::public-source-compatibility","line":38,"observation_digest":"055d88912a8703b350709ae8e1dec83f1a106f81a71b4d7ca5b55d0051419a13","observation_id":"aro_v1_avoyrejkq4b3gudqtluodxwih4","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/InvocationInfo.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_gllxxbgubf2bn2fv2ypdxga6v2","published_at":"2026-10-07T19:32:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ssd7q7x5jpe33rfm6lzecdecq7","reviewed_base_sha":"95a63f3a9db5d327620d76fb95b8372f53db6eaa","reviewed_head_sha":"6dc47901d6486cfe7968043711e39dafaa4e58b9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":37,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":765},"record_id":"art_v1_gxgp57bvqtk3hgc6gkgkkk6cdo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T19:32:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
